---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import JsonLd from '../../components/JsonLd.astro';
import { ENGLISH } from '../../i18n/langs';

Astro.locals.lang = ENGLISH;

const ld0 = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://tmplayer.org/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Support",
      "item": "https://tmplayer.org/support/"
    }
  ]
};
---
<Base path="/support/" title="Support TMPlayer: sponsor, star or share it" description="Ways to support TMPlayer: sponsor it, buy a coffee, star it on GitHub or tell a friend. All voluntary, and nothing is locked behind it.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <JsonLd data={ld0} />
  </Fragment>
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="TMPlayer home"><img class="brand-mark" src="/favicon.svg" width="30" height="30" alt=""><span class="brand-name">TMPlayer</span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="site-nav" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/features/">Features</a><a href="/download/">Download</a><a href="/install/">Install</a><a class="only-menu" href="/android-tv/">Android TV</a><a href="/faq/">Questions</a></nav><div class="nav"><a class="nav-icon" href="https://github.com/dracu-lah/TMPlayer" rel="noopener" aria-label="TMPlayer on GitHub"><Icon name="github" />
        <span class="nav-icon-count is-loading" data-count="stars" data-count-skeleton aria-hidden="true"></span></a><button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch to dark theme"><Icon name="sun-path" /><Icon name="moon" /></button><button class="menu-btn" id="menu-btn" type="button" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-nav"><Icon name="menu" /><Icon name="menu-close" /></button></div>
  </div>
</header>
<main id="main" class="policy-page">
  <div class="wrap policy-wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Support the project</p>
    <h1>Support TMPlayer</h1>
    <p class="policy-lede">TMPlayer is free and open source, with no ads of its own, no paid tier and no account of ours. Everything here is voluntary and unlocks nothing: every feature is free for everyone, whether or not you ever do any of it.</p>

    <section id="chip-in">
      <h2>Chip in</h2>
      <p>If TMPlayer saves you some bother, a coffee or a monthly sponsorship pays for the time that goes into it. Any amount is welcome, and one coffee is plenty.</p>
      <div class="support-actions support-give">
        <a class="btn btn-filled" href="https://github.com/sponsors/dracu-lah" rel="noopener">
          <Icon name="heart-btn" />
          Sponsor on GitHub
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/nevil.dev" rel="noopener">
          <Icon name="coffee-btn-plain" />
          Buy me a coffee
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="support-codes">
            <figure>
              <Icon name="qr-sponsors" />
              <figcaption>Scan for GitHub Sponsors</figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure>
              <Icon name="qr-coffee" />
              <figcaption>Scan for Buy Me a Coffee</figcaption>
            </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="star">
      <h2>Star it on GitHub</h2>
      <p>A star costs nothing and takes one click. It is how the next person, reading a GitHub page cold, learns that somebody else already trusted this app.</p>
      <div class="support-actions support-give">
        <a class="btn btn-filled" href="https://github.com/dracu-lah/TMPlayer" rel="noopener">
          <Icon name="star-btn" />
          Star on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="share">
      <h2>Tell a friend</h2>
      <p>Know someone who watches Telegram videos on a TV or a computer? Sending them <a href="https://tmplayer.org/">tmplayer.org</a> helps more than it sounds.</p>
      <div class="support-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-filled" href="https://t.me/share/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftmplayer.org%2F&amp;text=TMPlayer%20plays%20your%20Telegram%20videos%20on%20a%20big%20screen.%20Free%2C%20no%20ads." rel="noopener">Share on Telegram</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="mailto:?subject=TMPlayer&amp;body=TMPlayer%20plays%20your%20Telegram%20videos%20on%20a%20big%20screen.%20Free%2C%20no%20ads%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Ftmplayer.org%2F">Share by email</a>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline js-only" data-copy="https://tmplayer.org/">Copy the link</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Already supporting?</h2>
      <p>Thank you, truly. You do not need to do anything here, and the app will not ask again once you tell it (Settings, or the card that asks). TMPlayer asks at most three times, ever.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap footer-inner">
    <p class="footer-brand">TMPlayer</p>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/features/">Features</a>
      <a href="/download/">Download</a>
      <a href="/install/">Install</a>
      <a href="/android-tv/">Android TV</a>
      <a href="/faq/">Questions</a>
      <a href="/changelog/">Changelog</a>
      <a href="/fire-tv/">Fire TV</a>
      <a href="/formats/">Formats</a>
      <a href="/translate/">Translate</a>
      <a href="/security/">Security</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/dracu-lah/TMPlayer" rel="noopener">Source</a>
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/legal/">Lawful use</a>
      <a href="https://nevil.dev" rel="noopener">nevil.dev</a>
    </nav>
    <nav class="footer-links footer-guides" aria-label="Guides">
      <a href="/guides/telegram-videos-on-android-tv/">Telegram on Android TV</a>
      <a href="/guides/telegram-videos-on-fire-tv/">Telegram on Fire TV</a>
      <a href="/guides/telegram-on-tv-without-casting/">Telegram without casting</a>
    </nav>
    <nav class="footer-links footer-community" aria-label="Community">
      <a href="https://t.me/tmplayerapp" rel="noopener">Telegram channel</a>
      <a href="https://t.me/tmplayer_chat" rel="noopener">Telegram group</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/dracu-lah/TMPlayer/discussions" rel="noopener">Discussions</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/dracu-lah" rel="noopener">Sponsor</a>
      <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/nevil.dev" rel="noopener">Buy me a coffee</a>
      <a href="mailto:hello@tmplayer.org">hello@tmplayer.org</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="footer-legal muted small">GPL-3.0, &copy; 2026 dracu-lah. Unofficial, not affiliated with Telegram. Use it only with content you own or may access.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
</Base>
